{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"1sw_fyv_g81","canonical_person_id":"1sw_fyv_g81","id_aliases":[],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["1sw_fyv_g81"],"persons":[{"id":"1sw_fyv_g81","label":"朱驕如（淮南衡山列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"朱驕如","mention_ids":["c-shiji-118-huainan:m021-0275"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m021-0275","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p021","quote":"朱驕如"}]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji118-huainan","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-118","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-118-huainan:m021-0275"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-118-huainan:p021"],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji118-huainan"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m021-0275","start":275,"end":278,"surface":"朱驕如","kind":"person","person_id":"1sw_fyv_g81","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p021","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p021","text":"淮南王見建已徵治，恐國陰事且覺，欲發，被又以為難，乃復問被曰：「公以為吳興兵是邪非也？」被曰：「以為非也。吳王至富貴也，舉事不當，身死丹徒，頭足異處，子孫無遺類。臣聞吳王悔之甚。願王孰慮之，無為吳王之所悔。」王曰：「男子之所死者一言耳。且吳何知反，漢將一日過成皋者四十餘人。今我令樓緩先要成皋之口，周被下潁川兵塞轘轅、伊闕之道，陳定發南陽兵守武關。河南太守獨有雒陽耳，何足憂。然此北尚有臨晉關、河東、上黨與河內、趙國。人言曰『絕成皋之口，天下不通』。據三川之險，招山東之兵，舉事如此，公以為何如？」被曰：「臣見其禍，未見其福也。」王曰：「左吳、趙賢、朱驕如皆以為有福，什事九成，公獨以為有禍無福，何也？」被曰：「大王之群臣近幸素能使眾者，皆前繋詔獄，餘無可用者。」王曰：「陳勝、吳廣無立錐之地，千人之聚，起於大澤，奮臂大呼而天下響應，西至於戲而兵百二十萬。今吾國雖小，然而勝兵者可得十餘萬，非直適戍之眾，釠鑿棘矜也，公何以言有禍無福？」被曰：「往者秦為無道，殘賊天下。興萬乘之駕，作阿房之宮，收太半之賦，發閭左之戍，父不寧子，兄不便弟，政苛刑峻，天下熬然若焦，民皆引領而望，傾耳而聽，悲號仰天，叩心而怨上，故陳勝大呼，天下響應。當今陛下臨制天下，一齊海內，汎愛蒸庶，布德施惠。口雖未言，聲疾雷霆，令雖未出，化馳如神，心有所懷，威動萬里，下之應上，猶影響也。而大將軍材能不特章邯、楊熊也。大王以陳勝、吳廣諭之，被以為過矣。」王曰：「茍如公言，不可徼幸邪？」被曰：「被有愚計。」王曰：「柰何？」被曰：「當今諸侯無異心，百姓無怨氣。朔方之郡田地廣，水草美，民徙者不足以實其地。臣之愚計，可偽為丞相御史請書，徙郡國豪桀任俠及有耐罪以上，赦令除其罪，產五十萬以上者，皆徙其家屬朔方之郡，益發甲卒，急其會日。又偽為左右都司空上林中都官詔獄（逮）書，［逮］諸侯太子幸臣。如此則民怨，諸侯懼，即使辯武隨而說之，儻可徼幸什得一乎？」王曰：「此可也。雖然，吾以為不至若此。」於是王乃令官奴入宮，作皇帝璽，丞相、御史、大將軍、軍吏、中二千石、都官令、丞印，及旁近郡太守、都尉印，漢使節法冠，欲如伍被計。使人偽得罪而西，事大將軍、丞相；一日發兵，使人即刺殺大將軍青，而說丞相下之，如發蒙耳。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m021-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"淮南王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m021-0004","start":4,"end":5,"surface":"建","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFABA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m021-0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"被","kind":"person","person_id":"h6u_yzh_mdx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m021-0028","start":28,"end":29,"surface":"被","kind":"person","person_id":"h6u_yzh_mdx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m021-0044","start":44,"end":45,"surface":"被","kind":"person","person_id":"h6u_yzh_mdx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m021-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"1yn_q66_ob5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m021-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"1yn_q66_ob5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m021-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"1yn